@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.58.0 (2026-11-25): The header names its prior version (owl:priorVersion), the form the archive tool extends. 1.57.0 (2026-11-25): A register root is added, as BRSF's standard (2.5c-xxi, archival partition) requires: the container the register itself is, marked isRegisterRoot, above every lineage and belonging to none. Until now the lineage's own backlog was the only container and so counted as the root, which made the archive tool protect the Lineage and the Mission it points to. The backlog of this lineage is now a member of the root. 1.56.0 (2026-11-25): The Lineage record now states lineageArchived false, the form the archive tool reads before it archives. 1.55.0 (2026-11-25): Merged register. The 54 delta files 1.1.0 to 1.54.0 are combined into one file holding the latest state of every item, so that BRSF's archive tool, which reads one file, can run. Nothing is added or changed in meaning: the latest state of each item and the formal outcome Out_Achieved (1.54.0) are kept; the free-text outcome of 1.53.0 is not carried over, its text stays in the closure report and in 1.53.0 in the git history."@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.59.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.58.0> , <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.57.0> ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.59.0" .











































































































ex:Register_Ch1011 a backlog:Backlog ;
    rdfs:label "Register of the chapters 10 and 11 work"@en ;
    backlog:hasIdentifier "Register_SEN0414_Ch1011" ;
    backlog:isRegisterRoot true .

